rchase Request Feature** - No UI for purchase requests\n3. **Unreliable Session Management** - Users logged out unexpectedly\n4. **My-Listings Page Issues** - Snapshot rendering problems\n5. **Demo Account Password Bypass** - Security concern for demo accounts\n\nThe application successfully implements core browsing, search, and filtering features, but has significant gaps in seller management, purchasing, and cart functionality."
